This licence covers the code in code/ and the page scripts. The data files in
data/ are derived data released under CC BY 4.0 with these credits: water
quality from UNEP GEMS/Water, Global Freshwater Quality Archive v3, open subset
(CC BY 4.0; stations.csv, station_series.json, station_model.csv,
page_stations.json, countries_measured.csv); world geology from Macrostrat map
tiles (CC BY 4.0; units_world.csv and the modelled layers); bedrock geology
from the British Geological Survey, Geology 625k (Open Government Licence
v3.0), and from Geological Survey Ireland and Geological Survey of Northern
Ireland, 1:500k bedrock (CC BY 4.0; Open Government Licence) (units_bi.csv,
bi_model.png, bi_areas.csv); rainfall from CRU CL 2.0, Climatic Research Unit,
University of East Anglia (New et al. 2002); places from GeoNames (CC BY 4.0;
places.csv, places.json); outlines from Natural Earth (public domain;
borders.json) and ONS boundaries (Open Government Licence v3.0); hill shading
from AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen and Tilezen). The text of the page and the
figures are released under CC BY 4.0.
